<title>UK: Citibank sets warrants on Carrefour.</title>
<headline>Citibank sets warrants on Carrefour.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Citibank N.A. has issued three million American-style call warrants, in two equal tranches, on Carrefour stock, lead manager Citibank S.A. said.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p>COMMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	    23.SEP.96	    LISTING	   PARIS</p>
<p> MIN EXER LOT   1000		   SPOT REFERENCE  2813 FRF</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT   EXPIRY    STRIKE    PRICE FRF PREMIUM   GEARING</p>
<p> CALL A    18.SEP.98 2750 FRF  46.90 FRF 14.43 PCT 6.0 X</p>
<p> CALL B    18.SEP.00 3250 FRF  49.80 FRF 33.24 PCT 5.6 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
